# Live site lock

Never edit, restyle, restructure, or add links to anything that is already live on webwisedigital.net unless the user gives an explicit confirmation in that conversation.

Live includes, without limitation: `index.html`, niche/landing pages, blog posts, legal pages, `homepage-v4.css`, `homepage-v4.js`, `sitemap.xml`, `robots.txt`, and other currently published marketing pages.

New work must be additive (new paths/files only) until the user confirms it may be wired into the live site.

Webwise OS lives in `webwise-os/` as a separate Next.js app. Do not change the root Vercel static site config to point at it unless confirmed.
